# AA-889: docs/ is tracked for Markdown (no more `git add -f`). This repo is PUBLIC: binaries, data
# exports, screenshots and local experiment trees stay local, and no page may hold account IDs, ARNs,
# resource IDs, secrets or real data (data standards DM-6.10). Security and infrastructure reports go
# to the private AA-Ecosys root repo, not here. Calibration samples are the one tracked data type.
/docs/**
!/docs/**/
!/docs/**/*.md
!/docs/calibration/data/*.json
# AA-976: copies of the root HTTP contracts this repo serves (byte-identical; tests validate the routes against them).
!/docs/contracts/*.openapi.yaml
# AA-899: the generated OpenAPI document (scripts/export_openapi.py); code-derived, no host or resource ID.
!/docs/api/openapi.json
# K-16 / DM-6.10: security investigations kept in the private root repo (docs/archive/cis-investigations/).
# Local copies may still exist in older checkouts; never let `git add docs/` publish them.
/docs/claude_audit/AA-432-per-tenant-api-key-feasibility.md
/docs/investigation/AA-543-platform-wide-design-investigation.md
/docs/investigation/AA-544-seo-context-rls-gap-investigation.md
/docs/investigation/aa-social-media-audit.md
/docs/investigations/llm-otel-tracing.md
/docs/AI-gent-for automation works/
/docs/aa-soscial-media-*/
/docs/AA339_compare_llm/
/docs/AA353_compare/
/docs/AI_content_AWS_Arc_test_playground.md
